{
  "slug": "appstore-prep",
  "name": "Appstore Prep",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A 5-skill bundle that captures the gnarly pre-submission failure modes — Apple Distribution + 3rd Party Mac Developer Installer signing, SwiftPM nested-bundle 409 fix, AppIcon white-border detection, OAuth Guideline 4.5/4.8 review-rejection prevention, and offline ASO metadata audit (keywords / subtitle / screenshots). Complements Blitz — Blitz handles ASC operations, this handles the artifact preparation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `aso-audit` (Use this skill to audit App Store / Mac App Store metadata before submission), `icon-check` (Use this skill to validate an iOS or macOS AppIcon.appiconset before submitting to App Store Connect), `oauth-review-check` (Use this skill to scan an iOS / macOS codebase for OAuth / sign-in flows that will be…), `privacy-manifest` (Use this skill to verify and generate `PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy` for an iOS / macOS app), `release-ios` (Use this skill to archive, export, and upload an iOS app to App Store Connect), `release-mac` (Use this skill when packaging or uploading a macOS Swift / SwiftPM app to the Mac App Store)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install appstore-prep@claude-community` from `Kevin-Wei-sudo/appstore-prep`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
